sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI
    participant AuthService
    participant ContentService
    participant CommentModeration
    participant Backend
    participant Database

    User->>UI: Browse culture tab or restaurant detail
    UI->>ContentService: Fetch cultural stories/routes
    alt Stories/routes load successfully
        ContentService-->>UI: Display content
        User->>UI: Like / Comment / Favorite
        alt User is logged in
            alt Action is "Like" or "Favorite"
                UI->>Backend: Send like/favorite request
                alt Already liked/favorited
                    Backend-->>UI: Show already performed status
                    UI-->>User: Update button state or tooltip
                else New action
                    Backend->>Database: Save like/favorite
                    Database-->>Backend: OK
                    Backend-->>UI: Confirm success
                    UI-->>User: Show updated UI
                end
            else Action is "Comment"
                UI->>CommentModeration: Check for rule violations
                alt Violates rules
                    CommentModeration-->>UI: Rejected, sensitive content
                    UI-->>User: Show reason, reject post
                else Clean comment
                    UI->>Backend: Submit comment
                    Backend->>Database: Save comment
                    Database-->>Backend: OK
                    Backend-->>UI: Confirm success
                    UI-->>User: Display comment
                end
            end
        else Not logged in
            UI-->>User: Show login prompt popup
        end
    else Load fails
        ContentService-->>UI: Error
        UI-->>User: Show failure message, allow retry
    end

    alt Like/Comment API error
        Backend--xUI: Server/API error
        UI-->>User: Show error, allow retry
    end

    User->>UI: Return to culture tab or continue browsing
